#section[Professional Summary]

*Frontend Engineer* with *6 years of experience* building scalable, high-performance web applications using *React*, *Next.js*, and *TypeScript*. Strong background in *frontend architecture*, *performance optimization*, and *micro-frontend development*. Specialized in developing *browser-based graphic editors* with advanced canvas interactions, *real-time collaboration*, and *AI-assisted design experiences*.

