OmiCall is a cloud-based VoIP communication platform that helps businesses manage customer interactions through call center operations, agent management tools, real-time dashboards, and CRM-integrated workflows.

- Developed *responsive web interfaces* using *React* and *Redux* for customer communication and call center management features.
- Built *reusable UI components* and integrated *REST APIs* to implement new product features.
- Fixed application issues, enhanced existing features, and improved the overall user experience.

